title Vinyl P2b: a mount that polkit refuses (an ssh session): the reason in the notice, the drive stays listed (480x320 and 320x480, their real density)
sizes 480x320 320x480
ppmm 630
allow-small
env VINYL_DEMO 1
env VINYL_DEMO_LIBRARY full
env VINYL_DEMO_STATE playing
env VINYL_DEMO_PAGE library
env VINYL_DEMO_DRIVES denied
keyboards 1
wait 1200
tap "Folders"
wait 700
tap "Generic Flash Disk"
wait 900
shot 01-notice
expect text "Could not mount it: this session is not allowed to mount drives."
expect text "USB DRIVES"
expect text "Generic Flash Disk"
expect noquit
